<title>USA: Checkers Drive-In names new ad agency.</title>
<headline>Checkers Drive-In names new ad agency.</headline>
<dateline>CLEARWATER, Fla. 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Checkers Drive-In Restaurants Inc said Tuesday it named Crispin, Porter &amp; Bogusky in Miami as its new agency of record for both creative and media advertising.</p>
<p>Crispin, Porter edged out over other agency finalists that included WestWayne, based in Tampa and Atlanta, and Fricks/Firestone, based in Atlanta, Checkers said in a news release.</p>
</text>
